+     * Pre-hash a raw secret before it is passed to password_hash() or password_verify().
+     *
+     * The bcrypt algorithm used by PASSWORD_DEFAULT silently truncates its input at 72 bytes, so
+     * the secret is first reduced to a fixed-length digest. This guarantees that the whole secret
+     * contributes to the stored hash regardless of its length.
+     *
+     * @param string $secret The raw secret.
